== a signal ignored at entry lists with an empty action:
trap -- '' SIGUSR1
sep
trap -- '' SIGUSR1
rc=0
== an action installed for that signal does not replace the listing:
trap -- '' SIGUSR1
sep
trap -- '' SIGUSR1
rc=0
== a signal that is not ignored at entry lists its action:
trap -- 'echo caught' SIGUSR1
rc=0
